#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:2
msgid "Whitelabel Settings |enterprise-only|"
msgstr "Marca blanca Configuración |enterprise-only|"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:7
msgid "Whitelabel customization is available only with an Enterprise license."
msgstr ""
"Marca blanca customization está disponible solo con un Enterprise "
"licencia."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:10
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:12
msgid ""
"|morpheus| Tenants can be WhiteLabeled with custom Logos, Colors, Copy, "
"and custom CSS. Sub-Tenants can be individually white-labeled, or the "
"Master Tenant Whitelabel can apply to all Sub-Tenants."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| Inquilinos puede ser WhiteLabeled con personalizado Logos, "
"Colors, Copy, y personalizado CSS. Sub-Inquilinos puede ser individually "
"white-labeled, o el Inquilino maestro Marca blanca puede aplicar a todos "
"Sub-Inquilinos."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:14
msgid "Enable Whitelabel"
msgstr "Enable Marca blanca"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:15
msgid ""
"Turns on the configured Whitelabel settings. Disabling will return the "
"Appliance to the default colors and logos, but the configured options "
"will remain saved and will apply if Whitelabel is re-enabled."
msgstr ""
"Turns en el configurado Marca blanca configuración. Disabling va a return"
" el Appliance a el predeterminado colors y logos, pero el configurado "
"opciones va a remain saved y va a aplicar si Marca blanca es re-"
"habilitado."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:16
msgid "Appliance Name"
msgstr "Appliance Nombre"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:17
msgid "Replaces |morpheus| in page titles."
msgstr "Replaces |morpheus| en página titles."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:18
msgid "Header Logo"
msgstr "Header Logo"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:19
msgid ""
"Top left header logo. Uploaded image is resized to 38 pixels high with a "
"proportional width at that height."
msgstr ""
"Top left header logo. Uploaded image es resized a 38 pixels high con a "
"proportional width en ese height."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:20
msgid "Disable Support Menu"
msgstr "Disable Soporte Menu"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:21
msgid "Enable this flag to hide the support dropdown menu in the header."
msgstr "Enable este flag a hide el soporte menú desplegable menu en el header."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:22
msgid "Support Menu Links"
msgstr "Soporte Menu Links"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:23
msgid ""
"Customize support links. Label Code can be used for translations and is "
"optional. Be sure to specify fully qualified url if linking to external "
"sites."
msgstr ""
"Customize soporte links. Label Code puede ser usado para translations y "
"es opcional. Be sure a especificar fully qualified url si linking a "
"external sites."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:24
msgid "Security Banner"
msgstr "Seguridad Banner"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:25
msgid ""
"The Security Banner section in ``/admin/settings#!whitelabel`` displays "
"content on the login screen for Security and Consent messaging and "
"warnings."
msgstr ""
"El Seguridad Banner sección en ``/admin/settings#!whitelabel`` displays "
"content en el inicio de sesión screen para Seguridad y Consent messaging "
"y warnings."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:26
msgid "Applicable at Global and Tenant levels"
msgstr "Applicable en Global y Inquilino niveles"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:27
msgid "Security Banner input field accepts plain text and markdown"
msgstr "Seguridad Banner entrada campo accepts plain text y markdown"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:28
msgid "Content is displayed below login section in scoped ``/login/auth`` pages."
msgstr ""
"Content es mostrado below inicio de sesión sección en scoped ``/inicio de"
" sesión/auth`` páginas."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:29
msgid "Footer Logo"
msgstr "Footer Logo"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:30
msgid ""
"Footer Logo in bottom left. Uploaded image is resized to 27 pixels high "
"with a proportional width at that height."
msgstr ""
"Footer Logo en bottom left. Uploaded image es resized a 27 pixels high "
"con a proportional width en ese height."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:31
msgid "Login Logo"
msgstr "Inicio de sesión Logo"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:32
msgid ""
"Logo shown on Login screen. Uploaded image is resized to 192 pixels wide "
"with an unbound height proportional to that locked width."
msgstr ""
"Logo shown en Inicio de sesión screen. Uploaded image es resized a 192 "
"pixels wide con un unbound height proportional a ese locked width."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:33
msgid "Favicon"
msgstr "Favicon"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:34
msgid "Must be a .ico file type."
msgstr "Debe be a .ico file tipo."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:35
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Restablecer"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:36
msgid ""
"When selected and Whitelabel settings are saved, associated logo is "
"returned to blank default value."
msgstr ""
"Cuando seleccionado y Marca blanca configuración son saved, associated "
"logo es returned a blank predeterminado valor."

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:39
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "Colors"

#: ../../administration/settings/whitelabel.rst:41
msgid ""
"Update Colors by entering HEX value or selecting the Color Selector pop-"
"up next to each filed and selecting a color."
msgstr ""
"Update Colors por entering HEX valor o selecting el Color Selector pop-up"
" next a cada filed y selecting a color."

